# DUSKLING M6, MERE EDGE (room 6): terraces down to the water past a gulper and a pebble beetle.
# Played from its way in with plain button presses (LEFT is the D-pad
# side, A the button side), found once by the route finder (cheat solve).
game duskling
wait 5
cheat room 6
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 30
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 6
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 32
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 14
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 33
hold LEFT+A 7
wait 14
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 28
hold LEFT+A 7
hold A 22
wait 2
expect room == 7
